    "_comment": "Hand-made pieces from the Tiled editor (M5-03, M5-04), stamped by the seed: data/maps/prefabs/*.tmx with the logic tileset (floor, wall, water, road); empty cells keep what the generator made. Objects: chest (opened by clicking: drops like a monster of rank chestLootAs at the area level), spawn (a pack starts there), entry (open pieces: a path joins it to the rest of the map), connector (rooms: where corridors come in). open = pieces for open areas (openPerArea [min, max] per area, at least minTilesFromEntry from the arrival point); rooms = rooms that replace a rectangle room on a dungeon floor (roomsPerFloor). areas = only there (empty = any area of that kind).",
